OL,3,GNEWSAAbattoir worker admits cruelty by
OL,4,Awalking on sheep
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former abattoir worker has admitted
OL,7,Fanimal cruelty by forcing a sheep
OL,8,Fagainst a door and walking on its back.
OL,10,FKhawaja Hussain, 26, worked at T&S
OL,11,FAbattoir in Arley, Warwickshire, which
OL,12,Fclosed last year following a probe into
OL,13,Fanimal welfare by the Food Standards
OL,14,FAgency (FSA).
OL,16,FHe appeared at Warwickshire Justice
OL,17,FCentre earlier where he pleaded guilty
OL,18,Fto causing unnecessary suffering to a
OL,19,Fprotected animal on 2 August 2024.
OL,21,FHe will be sentenced on 13 November.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
